						"type": "handler",
						"handler": "checkVatFiscalYearCorrections",
						"icon": "FileSearchOutline",
						"description": "For an administration whose fiscal year is not the calendar year: compare every filed BTW return of this fiscal year with the books, write a correction for each one that differs and total them. The EUR 1,000 threshold applies to that total."
					}
				]
			}
		},
		{
